<p begin="00:09:22.720" end="00:09:25.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know about it. I mean, I heard</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.080" end="00:09:28.399" style="s2">something about it, but I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.680" end="00:09:30.320" style="s2">exactly what it is. All I know is I want</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.399" end="00:09:32.000" style="s2">my people to be honest and if they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.320" end="00:09:33.839" style="s2">not going to be honest, they have to be</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.000" end="00:09:36.160" style="s2">prosecuted. I don&#39;t know about</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.839" end="00:09:37.680" style="s2">specifically, but because I view if</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.160" end="00:09:40.160" style="s2">people are not honest, they&#39;re stealing</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.680" end="00:09:42.320" style="s2">from me as president. They&#39;re stealing</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.160" end="00:09:44.320" style="s2">from me. So, I want my people to be</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.320" end="00:09:46.640" style="s2">honest, and if they&#39;re not honest, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.320" end="00:09:47.120" style="s2">have my DOJ go and do whatever they have</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.640" end="00:09:48.080" style="s2">to do.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.120" end="00:09:49.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t think you&#39;re okay with that</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.080" end="00:09:51.519" style="s2">investigation, Andrew?</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.120" end="00:09:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I Well, I I could I guess I can stop</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.519" end="00:09:55.360" style="s2">anything. Look,</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.120" end="00:09:57.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if my people are not I have no idea what</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.360" end="00:09:58.959" style="s2">he did. I have just heard about it a</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.040" end="00:10:01.200" style="s2">little while. I want the people that</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.959" end="00:10:02.399" style="s2">work for this administration to be 100%</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.200" end="00:10:04.160" style="s2">honest.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.399" end="00:10:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How mean, Mr. President,</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.160" end="00:10:10.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; how Means resigned today from HHS is</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.440" end="00:10:13.839" style="s2">Baja dead, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.880" end="00:10:16.880" style="s2">Uh, don&#39;t know her very well at all. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.839" end="00:10:17.360" style="s2">guess you&#39;re talking about it&#39;s a Bobby</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.880" end="00:10:18.800" style="s2">Kennedy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.360" end="00:10:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, you&#39;ll have to don&#39;t know. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.800" end="00:10:23.279" style="s2">doing great. Baja is doing great.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.600" end="00:10:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It sounds like you&#39;re talking about him</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.279" end="00:10:26.320" style="s2">specifically when you&#39;re talking about</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.720" end="00:10:29.040" style="s2">people stealing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.320" end="00:10:31.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, I would say this. If somebody is</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.040" end="00:10:33.600" style="s2">dishonest, I consider them not only</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.440" end="00:10:36.560" style="s2">against the country, I consider that</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.600" end="00:10:39.040" style="s2">dishonest against me. So, I will never I</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.560" end="00:10:41.120" style="s2">will never do anything to stop a</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.040" end="00:10:42.000" style="s2">prosecution if somebody is dishonest.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.120" end="00:10:43.279" style="s2">Yep.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.000" end="00:10:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How worried are you about the</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.279" end="00:10:45.360" style="s2">Mississippi Senate race? Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.800" end="00:10:47.040" style="s2">going to Mississippi?</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.360" end="00:10:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just hearing about it now from you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.040" end="00:10:50.320" style="s2">What What&#39;s wrong with Mississippi?</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.800" end="00:10:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you worried about losing the seat</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.320" end="00:10:53.519" style="s2">there?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.600" end="00:10:56.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are the poll numbers?</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.519" end="00:10:57.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are the pollith</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.079" end="00:10:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and what is it? What are the poll</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.279" end="00:10:59.200" style="s2">numbers?</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.000" end="00:11:01.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s tough to say, but they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.200" end="00:11:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mean, Cindy Hyde&#39;s been very popular.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.360" end="00:11:04.640" style="s2">If I need to, you know, I went</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.720" end="00:11:07.760" style="s2">Mississippi as like I did just about</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.640" end="00:11:09.680" style="s2">everything else in a landslide. So, if I</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.760" end="00:11:12.000" style="s2">need to get her over the top, I would go</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.680" end="00:11:14.640" style="s2">there. She&#39;s great. Cindy Hyde Smith is</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.000" end="00:11:16.959" style="s2">great. So, if I need to go, I mean, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.640" end="00:11:18.399" style="s2">pretty well booked up as you see, but if</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.959" end="00:11:20.320" style="s2">I need to go, I&#39;d go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.399" end="00:11:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, will you only endorse Vice</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.320" end="00:11:24.640" style="s2">President Vance if Republicans hold the</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.560" end="00:11:25.440" style="s2">majorities?</p>
