<p begin="00:11:25.440" end="00:11:29.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if Republicans don&#39;t hold the</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.200" end="00:11:31.600" style="s2">majorities, are you not going to endorse</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.839" end="00:11:32.800" style="s2">Vice President Vance for 2028?</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.600" end="00:11:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you get that idea?</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.800" end="00:11:36.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, you&#39;ve just said it&#39;s never</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.600" end="00:11:37.920" style="s2">happens.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.160" end="00:11:40.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never even thought of it. No, because</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.920" end="00:11:41.920" style="s2">we&#39;re just too we have too much time to</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.079" end="00:11:42.560" style="s2">be thinking about that. It&#39;s a long way</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.920" end="00:11:45.120" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.560" end="00:11:47.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where will you Todd Has Todd Blanch</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.120" end="00:11:47.600" style="s2">briefed you about the Corin Luendowski</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.120" end="00:11:49.200" style="s2">situation?</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.600" end="00:11:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, he hasn&#39;t. I just heard about it a</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.200" end="00:11:53.040" style="s2">little while ago. But I want my people</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.360" end="00:11:54.560" style="s2">to be honest. If he&#39;s honest, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.040" end="00:11:55.519" style="s2">good. If he&#39;s not honest, you have to</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.560" end="00:11:57.279" style="s2">pay a price.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.519" end="00:11:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And in all these tight races, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.279" end="00:12:01.279" style="s2">President, how do you think the Iran war</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.600" end="00:12:03.040" style="s2">has impacted the races?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.279" end="00:12:04.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, in one way, they love it because</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.040" end="00:12:06.320" style="s2">I&#39;m doing what should have been done by</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.480" end="00:12:09.040" style="s2">other presidents. In another way, maybe</p>
