<p begin="00:12:09.040" end="00:12:13.360" style="s2">which I knew immediately when I did it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.600" end="00:12:15.279" style="s2">But we can&#39;t let Iran have a nuclear</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.360" end="00:12:18.079" style="s2">weapon. I mean, in one way, people</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.279" end="00:12:20.639" style="s2">probably don&#39;t love it, but many people,</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.079" end="00:12:22.320" style="s2">many great patriots really love it. This</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.639" end="00:12:24.639" style="s2">should have been done a long time ago by</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.320" end="00:12:26.800" style="s2">other presidents, the Iran war, and</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.639" end="00:12:28.399" style="s2">we&#39;ve knocked the hell out of them. And</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.800" end="00:12:30.160" style="s2">we may do it a little bit further. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.399" end="00:12:34.240" style="s2">you, Mr. President. Was it a mistake to</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.160" end="00:12:34.240" style="s2">slow down the battlefield over Ukraine?</p>
